      },
      "message": "test(app): fixture_library folder resolver uses host-absolute paths\n\nThe override and HOME cases fed Unix paths (/shop/fixtures, /Users/me,\n/home/me). store.rs keeps an override only when PathBuf::is_absolute() on\nthe host, so on Windows those paths were dropped and the test failed.\nPick each absolute path per OS with cfg!(windows), as machine_edit.rs\nalready does, and build the expected folders with PathBuf::join. The\nassertions keep their meaning: an absolute override wins, a relative one\nfalls back to HOME, and the macOS and linux data folders are unchanged.\n\nFixes #723\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
